    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChainKit Builder is  virtual workshop where you can experience the joy of building model kits. Assemble, cut, paint, kitbash and customize your models with precision and creativity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build: Snap parts together with satisfying realism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint: Use various paint tools to add color and detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut: Trim parts for a perfect fit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning: Remove mold lines and prepare parts for painting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change Mat: Swap out cutting mat for different effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decals: Apply and customize stickers for authenticity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo Mode: Take a photo of model kits with different background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop Showcase: Build own workshop from zero to hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitbash: Combine parts from different model kits to create something new.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing Music: Choose different soundtrack while enjoy building model kit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the relaxing yet challenging world of model building without the mess. Perfect for hobbyists or anyone looking to try their hand at crafting detailed models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MODEL KIT GRADES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SG</strong> = Standard Grade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NG</strong> = Novice Grade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EG</strong> = Elite Grade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PG</strong> = Prime Grade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your collection and become a master model kit builder with ChainKit Builder on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO AI </strong><br><strong>ALL ASSETS OF THIS GAME ARE HANDMADE BY OUR ARTIST, NO AI USED.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChainKit Builder is  virtual workshop where you can experience the joy of building model kits. Assemble, cut, paint, kitbash and customize your models with precision and creativity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build: Snap parts together with satisfying realism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint: Use various paint tools to add color and detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut: Trim parts for a perfect fit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning: Remove mold lines and prepare parts for painting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change Mat: Swap out cutting mat for different effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decals: Apply and customize stickers for authenticity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo Mode: Take a photo of model kits with different background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop Showcase: Build own workshop from zero to hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitbash: Combine parts from different model kits to create something new.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing Music: Choose different soundtrack while enjoy building model kit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the relaxing yet challenging world of model building without the mess. Perfect for hobbyists or anyone looking to try their hand at crafting detailed models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MODEL KIT GRADES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SG</strong> = Standard Grade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NG</strong> = Novice Grade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EG</strong> = Elite Grade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PG</strong> = Prime Grade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your collection and become a master model kit builder with ChainKit Builder on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO AI </strong><br><strong>ALL ASSETS OF THIS GAME ARE HANDMADE BY OUR ARTIST, NO AI USED.</strong></p>",
